---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: false
reel: true
description: "LRACDIMENSION is the engineering environment of John Carl Dimatulac: web systems, automation, and the tools behind them, organised into five working dimensions."
---
{%- from "partials/rd-icons.njk" import icon -%}
{%- set dimIcons = { work: 'boxes', vector: 'gauge', signal: 'activity', forge: 'wrench', research: 'file-text' } -%}
{%- set stack = ['React', 'Next.js', 'Vue', 'TypeScript', 'Tailwind CSS', 'GSAP', 'Node.js', 'Express', 'PHP', 'PostgreSQL', 'MySQL', 'MongoDB', 'Firebase', 'WordPress', 'REST APIs', 'n8n', 'OpenRouter', 'Vercel', 'Railway', 'Cloudflare', 'GitHub Actions'] -%}
<section class="rd-hero">
  <div class="rd-wrap rd-hero__in">
    <p class="rd-badge" data-enter>{{ icon('sparkles') }} Web systems · Automation · Diagnostics · AI visibility</p>
    <h1 class="rd-hero__title"><span class="rd-w" style="--i:0">Beyond</span> <span class="rd-w" style="--i:1"><span class="signal">Engineering</span>.</span></h1>
    <p class="rd-hero__sub" data-enter>Slow pages, no visibility on Google or AI, and a team still copying work between spreadsheets and inboxes — that is where growth stalls. I fix the whole chain: a fast website that gets found and converts, automations that remove the manual work, and the systems that run your operation behind it. Start by examining the site you already have.</p>
    <form class="rd-examine" action="/vector/" method="get" novalidate data-rd-examine data-enter>
      {{ icon('globe') }}
      <label class="rd-sr" for="rd-examine-url">Your website address</label>
      <input id="rd-examine-url" name="url" type="text" inputmode="url" autocomplete="url" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" placeholder="https://example.com" aria-describedby="rd-examine-note" required>
      <button type="submit" class="rd-btn rd-btn--white">Examine website<span class="rd-btn__chip">{{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></button>
    </form>
    <p class="rd-examine__note" id="rd-examine-note">Free Vector report · Performance · Accessibility · Security · SEO, AEO &amp; GEO readiness</p>
    <p class="rd-hero__alt">Not a website problem? <a href="/diagnose/">Find where your work stalls {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a></p>
    <p class="hero-badge" data-vector-badge hidden></p>
  </div>
  <div class="rd-wrap rd-hero__stage">
    <div class="rd-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="rd-frame" data-rd-frame>{% include "partials/motion-reel.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="rd-strip">
  <p class="rd-t-cap" data-enter>The tools I work with, every day</p>
  <div class="rd-marquee" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="rd-marquee__track">
      {%- for t in stack %}<span class="rd-chip">{{ icon('code-xml') }}{{ t }}</span>{% endfor -%}
      {%- for t in stack %}<span class="rd-chip">{{ icon('code-xml') }}{{ t }}</span>{% endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="rd-sec rd-tools" id="free-tools">
  <div class="rd-wrap">
    <header class="rd-sec__head">
      <span class="rd-badge rd-badge--pill" data-enter><span class="rd-badge__tag">Free</span> No account, no email, answers in minutes</span>
      <h2 class="rd-t-h2" data-enter>Find the leak <span class="signal">before you hire anyone.</span></h2>
      <p class="rd-t-sub" data-enter>Four free tools that show where your business loses leads, time and visibility — and what fixes it.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="rd-tools__grid">
      <article class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-tool rd-tool--wide rd-tool--feature" data-enter>
        <div class="rd-tool__body">
          <span class="rd-icon-chip">{{ icon('workflow') }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-upper">Business systems · 2 minutes</span>
          <h3 class="rd-t-h3">Bottleneck Finder</h3>
          <p class="rd-t-body">Ten questions about how your business runs. See where you lose leads, time and cash, ranked by what each leak costs, with the system that removes it.</p>
          <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--white" href="/diagnose/">Find my bottlenecks<span class="rd-btn__chip">{{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="rd-tool__preview" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="rd-t-upper">Example result</p>
          <div class="rd-tool__ring"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 120"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="52"/></svg><b>62%</b><span>High leakage</span></div>
          <ol>
            <li><span>Slow first response</span><i>●●●</i></li>
            <li><span>Double entry</span><i>●●○</i></li>
            <li><span>Billing lags the work</span><i>●●○</i></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-tool" data-enter>
        <div class="rd-tool__body">
          <span class="rd-icon-chip">{{ icon('gauge') }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-upper">Website · about a minute</span>
          <h3 class="rd-t-h3">Website examination</h3>
          <p class="rd-t-body">Eight analyzers grade speed, SEO, accessibility, security and AI visibility, with every issue's evidence and a prioritised fix list.</p>
          <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/vector/">Examine my website {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-tool" data-enter>
        <div class="rd-tool__body">
          <span class="rd-icon-chip">{{ icon('mail') }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-upper">Email · seconds</span>
          <h3 class="rd-t-h3">Email deliverability</h3>
          <p class="rd-t-body">Are your invoices, booking confirmations and form replies landing in spam? Check SPF, DKIM and DMARC, with the fix for each problem.</p>
          <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/forge/email-deliverability/">Check my email {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-tool rd-tool--wide" data-enter>
        <div class="rd-tool__body">
          <span class="rd-icon-chip">{{ icon('sparkles') }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-upper">SEO · AEO · GEO</span>
          <h3 class="rd-t-h3">AI visibility toolkit</h3>
          <p class="rd-t-body">Get found by search engines and cited by AI assistants. Generate the structured data, AI-crawler rules and llms.txt your site is missing.</p>
          <div class="rd-tool__links">
            <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/forge/schema-generator/">Structured data {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a>
            <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/forge/ai-crawler-policy/">AI crawler policy {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a>
            <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/forge/llms-txt-generator/">llms.txt {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rd-sec" id="dimensions">
  <div class="rd-wrap">
    <header class="rd-sec__head">
      <h2 class="rd-t-h2" data-enter>Five environments. <span class="signal">One system.</span></h2>
      <p class="rd-t-sub" data-enter>Each dimension is a capability area with something you can open, read, or run. Together they are the evidence for what I build.</p>
    </header>
    <ol class="rd-svc-grid rd-svc-grid--5" aria-label="Dimensions">
      {%- for d in dimensions %}
      <li data-enter>
        <a class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-svc" href="{{ d.href }}">
          <span class="rd-icon-chip">{{ icon(dimIcons[d.slug]) }}</span>
          <span class="rd-svc__n">{{ d.index }}</span>
          <span class="rd-svc__txt">
            <span class="rd-t-upper">{{ d.descriptor }}</span>
            <span class="rd-t-h3">{{ d.name }}</span>
            <span class="rd-t-body">{{ d.summary }}</span>
            <span class="rd-svc__list">{% for v in d.verbs %}<span class="rd-tag">{{ v }}</span>{% endfor %}</span>
            <span class="rd-t-cap">Proves: {{ d.proves }} · {{ 'In build' if d.status == 'building' else 'Live' }}</span>
          </span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--tight" id="selected-work">
  <div class="rd-wrap">
    <header class="rd-sec__head">
      <h2 class="rd-t-h2" data-enter>Selected <span class="signal">work</span>.</h2>
      <p class="rd-t-sub" data-enter>Three of fifteen. Client work, a working demo, and an independent concept, each with a real screenshot and a case study that states the problem, the architecture, and what shipped.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="rd-work">
      {%- for project in portfolio | slice_first(3) %}
      <a class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-work__card" href="/work/{{ project.slug }}/" data-enter>
        {%- if project.image %}<span class="rd-shot"><img src="/assets/img/projects/{{ project.image }}.webp" width="{{ project.imageWidth }}" height="{{ project.imageHeight }}" alt="{{ project.title }} website homepage" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>{% endif %}
        <span class="rd-work__txt">
          <span class="rd-t-upper">{{ project.kind }} · {{ project.field }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-h4">{{ project.title }} {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-body">{{ project.summary }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="rd-btn-row rd-more"><a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/work/">All {{ portfolio.length }} projects {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rd-sec" id="what-i-build">
  <div class="rd-wrap rd-split">
    <div class="rd-split__txt">
      <span class="rd-badge rd-badge--pill" data-enter><span class="rd-badge__tag">What I build</span> Three layers, one system</span>
      <h2 class="rd-t-h2" data-enter>The interface. The engine. <span class="signal">The connection.</span></h2>
      <a class="rd-btn rd-btn--white" href="/services/" data-enter>Services in detail<span class="rd-btn__chip">{{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</span></a>
    </div>
    <ol class="rd-sys">
      <li class="rd-sys__row" data-enter><span class="rd-sys__n">01</span><h3 class="rd-sys__t">Websites and web applications</h3><p class="rd-t-body">React and TypeScript interfaces, WordPress platforms with custom plugins and REST integrations, connected to Node.js, PHP, and database-backed services.</p></li>
      <li class="rd-sys__row" data-enter><span class="rd-sys__n">02</span><h3 class="rd-sys__t">Business systems and automation</h3><p class="rd-t-body">Operations systems, message centres, learning platforms, and n8n pipelines that move work between the tools a team already uses.</p></li>
      <li class="rd-sys__row" data-enter><span class="rd-sys__n">03</span><h3 class="rd-sys__t">Engines and data tools</h3><p class="rd-t-body">The analysis, scoring, and monitoring layers behind those systems: the engines that run Vector and Signal on this site.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rd-sec rd-sec--tight" id="approach">
  <div class="rd-wrap">
    <header class="rd-sec__head">
      <h2 class="rd-t-h2" data-enter>Diagnose first. <span class="signal">Build the smallest system that works.</span></h2>
    </header>
    <ol class="rd-steps">
      {%- for step in process %}
      <li class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-step" data-enter>
        <span class="rd-step__n">{{ loop.index0 | pad }}</span>
        <span class="rd-t-upper">{{ step.duration }}</span>
        <h3 class="rd-t-h4">{{ step.title }}</h3>
        <p class="rd-t-body">{{ step.lede }}</p>
        <p class="rd-t-cap"><b>Output:</b> {{ step.output }}</p>
      </li>
      {%- endfor %}
    </ol>
    <div class="rd-btn-row rd-more"><a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/process/">The full process {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rd-sec" id="research">
  <div class="rd-wrap">
    <header class="rd-sec__head">
      <h2 class="rd-t-h2" data-enter>Notes from <span class="signal">the field</span>.</h2>
      <p class="rd-t-sub" data-enter>Sourced articles and build logs on AI, web development, and how systems are put together.</p>
    </header>
    <div class="rd-svc-grid">
      {%- for post in collections.research | sort(false, false, "data.order") | slice_first(3) %}
      <a class="rd-card rd-card--hover rd-post" href="{{ post.url }}" data-enter>
        {%- if post.data.image %}<span class="rd-post__img"><img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="" width="1024" height="572" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span>{% endif %}
        <span class="rd-post__txt">
          <span class="rd-t-upper">{{ post.data.topic }} · {{ post.templateContent | reading_time }} min read</span>
          <span class="rd-t-h4">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
          <span class="rd-t-body">{{ post.data.description }}</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="rd-btn-row rd-more"><a class="rd-btn rd-btn--dark" href="/research/">All research {{ icon('arrow-up-right') }}</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/studio-contact.njk" %}
